      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      49.68,
      340.61,
      546.05,
      375.65
    ],
    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to (60-70) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Chilaw to Mannar via Kalpitiya and from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold",
      "Iskoola Pota"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      49.68,
      379.07,
      546.05,
      501.07
    ],
    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to (50-60) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Batticaloa to Mannar via Trincomalee and Kankasanthurai and from Chilaw to Matara via Colombo and Galle. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coasts extending from Chilaw to Mannar via Kalpitiya and from Matara to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be rough or very rough at times. Naval and fishing communities are advised not to venture into these sea areas, until further notice.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      49.68,
      509.35,
      546.02,
      575.47
    ],
    "text": "The sea areas off the coasts extending from Batticaloa to Mannar via Trincomalee and Kankasanthurai and from Chilaw to Matara via Colombo and Galle will be rough at times. The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
