      578.11,
      545.83,
      614.83
    ],
    "text": "The wave height may increase about (2.5 \u2013 3.0) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Hambantota.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
